      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "value": "\n<ol><li dir=\"ltr\">\u2026</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">[... she will] serve, attend, honor, and esteem [h]im, in the manner\u00a0 [...]\u00a0\u00a0</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">[...] twenty-[fi]ve, according to the practice of the congregation, and the remainder he added for moha[r ... ]\u00a0\u00a0</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">[... He will not be obligated for its payment unless he divorces willfully, without (her being guilty of) miscon[duct ...]\u00a0</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">[... from the hou]se of her fathers: a pair of golden rings crowned (with pearls) and six rings, three gold and three [silver ...]</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">[...] plain\u201430 din., two pearl beads in earrings\u201410 din., a silver\u201415\u00a0 din., a turn-table(?)\u2014[X] din. [...]\u00a0\u00a0</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">[...] a gilded white-grey [he]adband\u201410 din., a gilded white-grey headband\u20148 din., a coat made of different materials\u2014[...]</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">[...]\u20145 din., a bathrobe and a wrap\u20145 din., 2 \u02bfa\u1e63ab\u012b makht\u016bmas\u201436 (?) din., [...]</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">[...]\u2014din. [...]</li></ol>\n",
